  "description": "An ordinary woman with a freelancing career named Mina encountered a troublesome customer online. It turns out that her troublesome customer is Jinho, her timid and shy next door neighbor. With Mina and Jinho going through personal troubles, will they be able to find solace together?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60411486), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1962106156), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/romance_of_mean), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000057644), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10378548)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nEnglish ([Dashtoon](https://dashtoon.com/comics/read/ordinary-love_SHO49odFcr1Z2fUbz5E), [HyperComic](https://play.hypercomic.io/Webtoon/episode/87/), [MangaPlaza](https://mangaplaza.com/title/0303011551/), [Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/dp/B0BTJDK9YD/)",
